<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Bula chairman and chief executive resigns.</title>
<headline>Bula chairman and chief executive resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bula Resources (Holdings) Plc said on Tuesday that Jim Stanley, who has been anxious to pursue his other mining interests for some time, has resigned as chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>T.J. Fitzpatrick has taken over as interim chairman and finance director Pat Mahony has been appointed as interim managing director.</p>
<p>Company secretary I.W. Walpole has been appointed as interim chief financial officer, Bula said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company said it anticipated that new appointments would be made shortly.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
